{
  "tck": "GAGS Technology Compliance Kit",
  "standard": "GAGS",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Implementation-independent conformance profile. Each GAGS requirement is classified as 'black-box' (verified by exercising the candidate implementation's HTTP API — no source access) or 'attestation' (the implementer declares conformance and supplies an evidence pointer, because the property is not observable over the wire). A candidate is TCK-conformant when every black-box L1 MUST check passes against its live endpoint AND every attestation-class requirement is covered by the supplied attestation manifest. This kit tests ANY implementation, not just GovernPilot.",
